# Flight Delay Risk Predictor & EU 261 Legal Advisor

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10%2B-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/)
[![Framework](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-1.28%2B-red.svg)](https://streamlit.io/)
[![Machine Learning](https://img.shields.io/badge/LightGBM-Classifier-green.svg)](https://lightgbm.readthedocs.io/)
[![RAG Engine](https://img.shields.io/badge/FAISS-VectorStore-orange.svg)](https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss)
[![MLOps](https://img.shields.io/badge/MLflow-Experiment_Tracking-blueviolet.svg)](https://mlflow.org/)
[![Docker](https://img.shields.io/badge/Docker-Ready-2496ED.svg)](https://www.docker.com/)

**Flight Delay & EU 261 Legal Advisor** adalah sistem kecerdasan buatan terpadu (*end-to-end AI system*) yang menggabungkan **Predictive Machine Learning** untuk menghitung risiko keterlambatan penerbangan dengan **Generative AI (RAG Engine)** untuk konsultasi hukum hak kompensasi penumpang pesawat berdasarkan Regulasi Uni Eropa (**EU 261/2004**).

